{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026qoLipUDftc1793811185.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>行政長官李家超從北京轉抵上海，明天出席第九屆中國國際進口博覽會。</p><p></p><p>李家超在社交平台指，將在進博會向海內外政商界，介紹香港融入和服務國家發展大局、成果和機遇，亦會參觀企業商業展。</p><p></p><p>他指滬港兩地向來淵源深厚、合作緊密，今年《施政報告》提及，兩地合作推出的貿易數據互通試點上月推行，有望惠及從內地出口貨品的香港中小企貿易商，而香港亦正積極拓展與內地港口協作，推動今年內與上海建立「兄弟港」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T18:21:34.858647+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":192,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T15:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T18:38:17.400885+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T18:14:27.174849+00:00","content_hash":"d14b4f7f8e84c2418474427f1b65d8ac46b503eb65b53fa4d8ff76af9b31dd4e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-04T18:21:34.858647+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}